WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.322
You do not need previous work experience.

00:00:02.322 --> 00:00:05.640
You will respond to a situation at a fictional workplace.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.294
Show how you think and explain your decision.

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:13.066
The cards contain the messages, facts and rules for your question.

00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:14.583
Read them before answering.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:17.996
Use the information provided, without looking things up elsewhere.

00:00:18.596 --> 00:00:21.469
Open Words in this question for a plain-language definition.

00:00:21.469 --> 00:00:27.216
For example, a support ticket is a record of a customer problem and the steps taken to help.

00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:32.596
Choose an action and explain why, or write a short response as requested.

00:00:32.596 --> 00:00:35.170
Some questions ask for a spoken update.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.009
Clear, everyday language is enough.

00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:40.860
Watch this guide or read the same introduction as text.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:45.087
Read the instructions on this page, then press Start when you are ready.

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:48.338
AI assistance is available only on the first two questions.

00:00:48.338 --> 00:00:50.614
Stay in the assessment tab while answering.
